pi-star includes UI code copied from pi-web and runtime code copied from pi-rust.

pi-web
Copyright (c) pi-web contributors
License: MIT
Source: https://github.com/agegr/pi-web

The copied client modules are listed and regenerated by
scripts/sync-ui-from-pi-web.mjs; see ui/UPSTREAM.md.

pi-rust (rpi)
Copyright (c) 2026 pi-rust contributors
Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi)
License: MIT
Source: https://github.com/bigfish1913/pi-rust
Merged at rpi 0.14.0, commit.id 534bcbffb7e1e7551d9ee3572dfeb278e203e493.

The Agent runtime under crates/pi-star-ai, pi-star-agent, pi-star-tools and
pi-star-harness is a source copy of the corresponding rpi crates, renamed and
modified for pi-star. It is maintained in this repository; see
docs/upstream-rpi.md for the mapping and the local changes.

JetBrains Mono
Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
(https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)
License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (ui/public/fonts/OFL.txt)
Source: https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono, v2.304

The bundled WOFF2 is the upstream variable font (weights 100-800) in a WOFF2
container, served from ui/public/fonts and used as the default monospace face.

Noto Sans Mono / Noto Sans Mono CJK SC
Copyright 2015-2024 Google LLC
License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (ui/public/fonts/OFL.txt)
Sources: https://github.com/notofonts/noto-fonts
         https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk
The bundled Noto Sans Mono is a WOFF2 conversion of the variable upstream font,
subset to Latin, Greek, Cyrillic, punctuation and terminal symbols. The CJK face
is the full Simplified Chinese mono font, served as WOFF2 and gated by a CJK
unicode-range so it is only fetched when a CJK glyph is needed.

JetBrainsMono Nerd Font
Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
Patched by the Nerd Fonts project (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts)
License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (ui/public/fonts/OFL.txt);
         Nerd Fonts patching scripts are MIT (ui/public/fonts/NERD-FONTS-LICENSE.txt)
Source: https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts, v3.5.1
The bundled WOFF2 files are the Regular and Bold patched faces.

